      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-A10786-aa59eb69",
      "start": 1046,
      "end": 1095,
      "text": "But let this passe, and to the second heede take,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[4]/lg[4]/l[3]",
        "gate": 4,
        "stanza": 4,
        "line": 3,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r4:25",
      "document_id": "r4",
      "document_sha256": "d4c6075fd69e3be395633c2234d500c26bcfaa67a939a5b83f4a6d4c1ba9a122",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-A10786-aa59eb69",
      "start": 1096,
      "end": 1143,
      "text": "Which as I saide is after Seperation celebrate,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[4]/lg[4]/l[4]",
        "gate": 4,
        "stanza": 4,
        "line": 4,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "r4:26",
      "document_id": "r4",
      "document_sha256": "d4c6075fd69e3be395633c2234d500c26bcfaa67a939a5b83f4a6d4c1ba9a122",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-A10786-aa59eb69",
      "start": 1144,
      "end": 1197,
      "text": "In which the parties be left with least to colligate,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[4]/lg[4]/l[5]",
        "gate": 4,
        "stanza": 4,
        "line": 5,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
